# A Quality Metric Algorithm

Algorithm 1 Quality Preservation Metric   
Input: User Query $q$ Input: Pipeline Output $C_L$ Input: Target Output $C_T$ Input: LLM Judge, $M_J$ Input: Prompt for Quality Judgment $f_{QJ}$ Output: $\mathrm{QUAL}(C_L,C_T)$ $s_1\gets int(f_{QJ}(M^J,q,C_L,C_T))$ $s_2\gets int(f_{QJ}(M^J,q,C_T,C_L))$ Reverse the order of candidate responses if $s_1 = s_2$ then return 1 The judgment is inconsistent else if $s1\neq s2$ then return s1 The judgment is consistent end if

